      "i39": "标题改成句首大写：<code>Dynamic capabilities and firm performance.</code>",
      "i40": "构建来源要素：<code>Journal of Business Research, 142(3), 45-67.</code>，其中期刊名和「142」斜体，「(3)」正体。",
